								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Well it sucks when almost every post I make someone tries and play internet superhero/badmutha.&nbsp; I know atleast my experience on the board has been really up and down.&nbsp; I been posting on eqvault, its quite more of a ghost town there but, it is back to normal, it is about eq and not about some of the garbage you see here or even worse, flamevault.&nbsp; It might be a good idea for me give up on the whole message board scene all together, I notice I grit my teeth less when I don&#039;t check these things.
						</td>
					</tr>
